Moreya is based on OpenDungeons, developed as a community effort since 2009, and on OpenDungeonsPlus.
This file aims at listing the contributors that were involved in shaping this
game over the years. See the CREDITS for a more
detailed listing of authors and licenses for the assets used in Moreya.

Please report issues at https://github.com/Rokk001/Moreya/issues


